  {
    "id": "party-dialogue-p09034-362db4afaf05-context",
    "source": "<b>Irma:</b> <indent=16%>I'm an old woman. I've no time to debate my own importance to the world. Death is coming soon. For both of us.</indent>\n<b>Guilda:</b> <indent=16%>Well, <i>that's</i> horribly morbid. Lady, I like your style.</indent>\n<b>Marcellus:</b> <indent=16%>And what of you, Playmaster? Are yeh gonna sit around an' let a bunch of girls call yeh useless?",
    "target": "<b>伊尔玛:</b> <indent=16%>我一把年纪了，没空争论自己对这世界有多重要。死期不远了。我们俩都是。</indent>\n<b>吉尔妲:</b> <indent=16%>哎呀，<i>这话</i>可真够晦气的。女士，我喜欢你这风格。</indent>\n<b>马塞勒斯:</b> <indent=16%>那你呢，戏剧大师？你就坐在那儿，任由一群姑娘说你没用？",
    "source_sha256": "e5d056e6a2f50d74f5f5ef02b9322c0eca46dbf4a3a445e41d4170174dce3547",
    "origins": [
      {
        "asset": "scenes",
        "asset_sha256": "6f4f49b19b3822498a7941716ea1353b8e9073dc4873406fa0fc351170acea0a",
        "scene": "GUILD_Party",
        "line": 25192
      }
    ]
  },
  {
