  {
    "id": "party-dialogue-p09036-fd85d11e8186-context",
    "source": "<b>Marcellus:</b> <indent=16%>And what of you, Playmaster? Are yeh gonna sit around an' let a bunch of girls call yeh useless?</indent>\n<b>Quince:</b> <indent=16%>Ah, my good Marcellus, how kind of you to call upon me.</indent>\n<b>Quince:</b> <indent=16%>As a master of the stage, my position is behind the curtains, out of sight and mind.",
    "target": "<b>马塞勒斯:</b> <indent=16%>那你呢，戏剧大师？你就坐在那儿，任由一群姑娘说你没用？</indent>\n<b>昆斯:</b> <indent=16%>啊，亲爱的马塞勒斯，多谢你想到我。</indent>\n<b>昆斯:</b> <indent=16%>身为舞台的掌控者，我的位置在幕后——无人看见，无人想起。",
    "source_sha256": "9e1cc74795b794b44df1866b800041365c830a38b00187f9f91cbacd34c383cb",
    "origins": [
